WEBVTT

02:19:25.209 --> 02:19:26.125
Hello.

02:19:26.500 --> 02:19:29.625
I found a guy here.
I have a feeling it's him.

02:19:30.375 --> 02:19:31.417
You found the guy?

02:19:31.709 --> 02:19:32.875
Why? Did you also find the guy?

02:19:33.125 --> 02:19:35.084
I don't know if the guy
you found is the guy.

02:19:35.167 --> 02:19:36.875
But the guy I found is definitely the guy.
